      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your ancestors built a life for you to leave, not to remove; a legacy's true health comes from its children surviving and thriving, even if the journey is difficult right now. You cannot clean away the pain by vanishing, for the name you carry is the very seed your family planted to grow, not the shell of your mistakes. One day, you might find peace in honoring who they were while letting the path forward be forged by your own hands, rather than trying to wipe it clean of your existence.",
